# Cinema Booking System

A web-based cinema seat reservation system developed as part of my second-year Computer Science university coursework.

## Technologies Used
- PHP
- MySQL / MariaDB
- HTML & CSS
- XAMPP
- phpMyAdmin

## Features
- User registration and login
- Session management
- Movie and seat selection
- Cinema booking functionality
- Admin booking approval
- Database integration

## Installation
1. Install XAMPP.
2. Copy the project files to `C:\xampp\htdocs\resit`.
3. Start Apache and MySQL.
4. Open `http://localhost/phpmyadmin`.
5. Create a database named `resit_db` and import `resit_db.sql`.
6. Open `http://localhost/resit/login.php`.

## About
This is an academic project created during my second year of undergraduate Computer Science studies. It is intended for educational purposes, not production use.
